Subject: [PATCH] fix(spot): TIA early unlock buy-pause until Sep 26 UTC
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Nasir 2026-09-22: hard-block TIA buys until 2026-09-26 00:00 UTC so the
calendar ±4d pad around the Sep 30 unlock takes over without a gap.
Runner already cancels buys via is_unlock_buy_paused; ARB pause unchanged.
---
