 trading_engine/spot/runner.py                 | 10 +++---
 trading_engine/spot/unlock_calendar.py        | 20 +++++++++--
 .../tests/test_tia_mission_revert_guards.py   | 36 +++++++++++++++----
 4 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

